			"notes": "This update is mostly focused on fixing major bugs and reworking roads, Read the README on how to use.\n\n***Changes:***\n- *Fixes*\n  - ```Secondary``` roads now build correctly instead of building the default road\n  - Fixed crashing when building over y255 on vanilla worlds\n  - Fix windows on buildings not generating when standing on a different y level than the building\n- *Improvements*\n  - Now doesn't build unregonized roads to prevent it building things that aren't real roads\n  - Make most roads thinner to make their size more realistic\n  - Fixed alleyways being 1 block too wide, and made driveways and drive-throughs one block thinner\n  - All ```service``` roads except driveways are now made of concrete\n  - Simple buildings now does less steps and are faster to generate\n- *Added*\n  - Added ```Tree rows``` and ```Hedges``` to the Trees setting"
		},
